QElectroTech macOS bundle (Homebrew, Qt 6, KF6)
===============================================

RESUME
------
These scripts build a signed and notarized QElectroTech DMG for macOS,
with Qt 6 and the KDE Frameworks QET uses:

- QT_FROM=aqt (default): official Qt binaries (aqtinstall), universal
  DMG for Apple Silicon and Intel Macs. Homebrew only provides the build
  tools (cmake, ninja, git, ccache).
- QT_FROM=brew: Homebrew Qt 6, arm64 DMG only (Homebrew no longer builds
  Intel bottles).

They are adapted from the digiKam Homebrew scripts by Gilles Caulier
(digikam/project/bundles/homebrew and 3rdparty/ext_kf6), reduced to what
QElectroTech needs, on the model of build-aux/linux/appimage. The
deployment, signing and DMG steps come from misc/MacQetDeploy_arm64_cmake.sh.

Location in the QET tree: build-aux/macos/homebrew/


